        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>手写笔记 - 列车效应</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #ddd;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px 0;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti\", \"STKaiti\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 560px;\n    min-height: 760px;\n    background-color: #fbfaf3;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(#e3e6da 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, #e3e6da 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 22px 22px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);\n    padding: 18px 34px 18px 46px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  /* ring binder holes */\n  .rings {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 6px;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-evenly;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .rings span {\n    width: 12px;\n    height: 12px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #cfcfc4;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .date-field {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #444;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #999;\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding-bottom: 2px;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 22px;\n    right: 40px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #b7c9d4;\n    transform: rotate(-6deg);\n    opacity: 0.8;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .watermark .icon {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n    background: #f0a500;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    margin: 0 3px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n\n  .content {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 2.15;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .content p {\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n  }\n\n  .indent {\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .highlight-box {\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(190, 230, 150, 0.55) 60%, rgba(190,230,150,0.0));\n    padding: 4px 6px 4px 2px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    color: #234d1f;\n  }\n\n  .highlight-box .label {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  /* right margin page-tab numbers */\n  .side-tabs {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -18px;\n    top: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .side-tabs span {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 20px;\n    background: #eee;\n    border: 1px solid #bbb;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n\n  /* left margin small illegible marks */\n  .left-marks {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -14px;\n    top: 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 40px;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #999;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n  }\n\n  .brand {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 14px;\n    left: 46px;\n    font-family: \"Georgia\", serif;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #b7b7ac;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 0;\n    height: 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"rings\">\n    <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n    <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n    <span></span><span></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"left-marks\">\n    [illegible] [illegible] [illegible] [illegible]\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"date-field\">Date</div>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">\n    <span class=\"icon\"></span>@田三术要务气球 | dd生\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"side-tabs\">\n    <span>F1</span>\n    <span>F2</span>\n    <span>F3</span>\n    <span>F4</span>\n    <span>F1c</span>\n    <span>F2f</span>\n    <span>F20</span>\n    <span>F21</span>\n    <span>F21</span>\n    <span>217</span>\n    <span>225</span>\n    <span>F28</span>\n    <span>229</span>\n    <span>231</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <p>了东南季风，形成强降水。</p>\n    <p>(3.) 受台风\"烟花\"逼近，带来了大量水汽</p>\n    <p>(4.) 这次的降水过程中，中小尺度对流反复在伏牛山前地</p>\n    <p class=\"indent\">区发展并向郑州方向移动，也就形成了\"列车效应\"</p>\n    <p class=\"indent\">导致降水强度大，维持时间长，引起局地极端降水。</p>\n\n    <div class=\"highlight-box\">\n      <p><span class=\"label\">△列车效应：</span>指长时间的降水并不是因为一块稳定不动的</p>\n      <p class=\"indent\">降雨云造成，而是对流系统反复生成发展，</p>\n      <p class=\"indent\">使很多降水云团先后经过同一个地方，造成同</p>\n      <p class=\"indent\">一地区出现长时间降水情况。就像列车的</p>\n      <p class=\"indent\">不同车厢先后经过同一铁轨一样，这种情</p>\n      <p class=\"indent\">况叫做列车效应。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"brand\">Campus</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
